INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: skeys
(Added by the FluidModel quark.) Return the keys as a sorted link::Classes/Array::. If the keys cannot be compared with each other (for example Symbols mixed with numbers), they are returned unsorted.

returns:: An link::Classes/Array::.

discussion::
code::
(b: 2, c: 3, a: 1).skeys;   // -> [ a, b, c ]
::
